1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,200
BILLION bilyard klubi — endi Telegramda!

2
00:00:04,933 --> 00:00:09,667
Telegramda @billionbiliard_bot ni oching va «Start» ni bosing.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:15,200
Shartlarga rozilik bering — klub menyusi darhol ochiladi.

4
00:00:15,267 --> 00:00:20,000
Raqamingizni bitta tugma bilan yuboring.

5
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:24,867
Klub kartangiz shu zahoti ochiladi — bonus har tashrifda to'planadi.

6
00:00:24,933 --> 00:00:31,333
«Bo'sh joylar» — qaysi stol bo'shligi va narxi bir qarashda.

7
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:37,533
Ilovada ham barcha stollar holati bilan ko'rinadi.

8
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:42,000
«Band qilish» — avval stolni tanlang…

9
00:00:42,133 --> 00:00:46,867
…so'ng o'zingizga qulay vaqtni belgilang.

10
00:00:47,133 --> 00:00:52,000
Ilovada kun va davomiylikni ham tanlash mumkin.

11
00:00:52,133 --> 00:00:56,867
Bron tasdiqlandi — stol sizni kutib turadi!

12
00:00:56,933 --> 00:01:01,200
«Bonuslarim» — darajangiz, bonuslar va tashriflar soni.

13
00:01:01,333 --> 00:01:05,533
Har darajada keshbek oshadi: 3% dan 10% gacha.

14
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:11,200
Ilovada — kartangiz va keyingi darajagacha qolgan summa.

15
00:01:11,267 --> 00:01:15,333
Sherik yo'qmi? «Raqib topish» ni bosing.

16
00:01:15,467 --> 00:01:21,000
Vaqt va darajani tanlang — so'rov klubning barcha o'yinchilariga boradi.

17
00:01:21,133 --> 00:01:26,533
Kim birinchi «O'ynayman!» ni bossa — o'sha siz bilan o'ynaydi.

18
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:32,533
Ilovada — so'rovlar ro'yxati va raqib bilan yozishma.

19
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:37,000
Administrator javobi Telegramga keladi…

20
00:01:37,133 --> 00:01:43,200
…«Javob berish» ni bosing va shu yerning o'zida yozing.

21
00:01:43,467 --> 00:01:47,867
Butun yozishma ilovada saqlanib qoladi.

22
00:01:47,933 --> 00:01:54,533
Do'stingizga shaxsiy havolangizni yuboring…

23
00:01:54,800 --> 00:02:00,200
…yoki QR-kodni ko'rsating. Uning birinchi chekidan 10% sizga!

24
00:02:00,267 --> 00:02:05,000
O'yindan so'ng chek darhol Telegramga keladi.

25
00:02:05,133 --> 00:02:10,533
Bonus avtomatik yoziladi — klubni baholashni unutmang!

26
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:16,000
Manzil, ish vaqti va telefon — hammasi ilovada.

27
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:22,367
BILLION — sizni kutamiz!
